  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_006) achieves the highest RNA-only accuracy (0.653), while image-only models (e.g., config_010) underperform. This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 RNA with the more capable imagenet_vit_l image encoder (vs resnet50) using transformer aggregation (proven effective for RNA) and concat fusion. It isolates the impact of image encoder quality and fusion strategy, addressing uncertainty about whether better image features can improve multimodal performance when paired with a strong RNA encoder."
